 "captions": [
  {
   "start": 0.17,
   "end": 2.13,
   "text": "You know exactly what you should be doing."
  },
  {
   "start": 2.52,
   "end": 5.18,
   "text": "So why are you scrolling your phone instead?"
  },
  {
   "start": 5.705,
   "end": 7.465,
   "text": "Most people call it laziness,"
  },
  {
   "start": 7.705,
   "end": 9.245,
   "text": "or bad time management."
  },
  {
   "start": 9.795,
   "end": 11.485,
   "text": "Researchers say it is neither."
  },
  {
   "start": 12.008,
   "end": 14.198,
   "text": "Procrastination is about feelings."
  },
  {
   "start": 14.628,
   "end": 17.218,
   "text": "A task feels boring, scary,"
  },
  {
   "start": 17.358,
   "end": 18.218,
   "text": "or just too big,"
  },
  {
   "start": 18.638,
   "end": 20.088,
   "text": "so your brain grabs something"
  },
  {
   "start": 20.108,
   "end": 21.818,
   "text": "that feels better right now."
  },
  {
   "start": 22.343,
   "end": 24.413,
   "text": "And the bill goes to your future self."
  },
  {
   "start": 24.883,
   "end": 27.993,
   "text": "A person your brain treats almost like a stranger."
  },
  {
   "start": 28.518,
   "end": 29.738,
   "text": "So don't wait to feel ready."
  },
  {
   "start": 30.088,
   "end": 32.838,
   "text": "Shrink the first step until it's too small to fear."
  },
  {
   "start": 33.058,
   "end": 34.188,
   "text": "Open the file."
  },
  {
   "start": 34.578,
   "end": 35.648,
   "text": "Write one line."
  },
  {
   "start": 36.165,
   "end": 38.795,
   "text": "The bad feeling usually fades once you start."
  },
  {
   "start": 39.325,
   "end": 42.645,
   "text": "So, what's the smallest first step you could take today?"
  }
